#: src/Application.vala:13
msgid ""
"APT can't be used to manage packages on this device because the system files "
"are immutable"
msgstr "這台裝置由於系統檔案是不可變的，因此無法使用 APT 管理軟體包"

#: src/Application.vala:15
msgid ""
"• Applications can be managed with Flatpak. See `flatpak --help` or use "
"AppCenter"
msgstr "• 應用程式可以利用 Flatpak 管理。請參見 `flatpak --help` 或是使用 AppCenter"

#: src/Application.vala:16
msgid ""
"• System updates can be managed with systemd-sysupdate. See `updatectl --"
"help` or open System Settings and visit System"
msgstr ""
"• 系統更新可以用 systemd-sysupdate 來進行管理。請參見 `updatectl --help` 或是"
"開啟《系統設定值》並造訪「系統」頁面"

#: src/Application.vala:18
msgid ""
"You can still use APT by specifying the absolute path like `/usr/bin/apt` or "
"`/usr/bin/apt-get` but sub-commands that need write access to the /usr "
"system files like `install` are not supported"
msgstr ""
"您如有需要還是可以利用完整絕對路徑（如 `/usr/bin/apt` 或 `/usr/bin/apt-get`）"
"來呼叫 APT，但需要寫入 /usr 系統檔案的子命令（像是 `install`）是不支援的"

#: src/Application.vala:20
#, c-format
msgid "For more information about how to install applications, visit %s"
msgstr "關於如何安裝應用程式的更多資訊請參考 %s"
